# Binary fixtures and assets must never have their line endings rewritten.
#
# `e2e/fixtures/sn2-notes.pdf` is a hand-built PDF whose bytes are almost all
# printable ASCII, so git's text/binary heuristic guessed "text" and queued it
# for LF→CRLF conversion on a Windows checkout. That shifts every byte offset
# after the first newline, and a PDF's xref table stores absolute offsets — the
# file would still look fine in a diff and fail to parse.
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.ico   binary
